subject_definitions:
<Subject 1> — 钱经理: a 45-year-old male property manager. Slightly overweight, slicked-back oily hair, round face, an ingratiating smile that flips into a scowl, white shirt buttoned to the closed collar under a dark grey buttoned waistcoat, dark grey trousers, black leather shoes. His voice is loud, nasal and bullying, standard Mandarin. It is the person shown in <Picture 1>.
<Subject 2> — 苏小满: a 25-year-old female cleaner. Preserve her exact face, small lean build, centre-parted black hair in a low practical ponytail, plain dark-navy button-up work shirt buttoned to the closed collar with small plain buttons down the front, a worn grey apron over dark navy trousers, black cloth shoes. Her voice is low, steady and slightly hoarse, standard Mandarin. It is the person shown in <Picture 2>.
<Subject 3> — 小唐: a 22-year-old female cleaning-team colleague. Thin, pale, narrow shoulders, shifty sidelong eyes, hair tied back in a low ponytail, light-grey button-up work shirt with a pointed collar and matching light-grey trousers, a light-grey apron tied round her waist, black cloth shoes. Her voice is small, thin and nervous. It is the person shown in <Picture 3>.
<Picture 4>: the office layout reference for 万山大厦 — this same single room is the set for the whole clip. Light-oak storage cabinets along the back-left wall with plain brown cardboard boxes stacked on top; a low wooden credenza under the back window with a printer, files and two potted green plants; an L-shaped wooden office desk with a black monitor, keyboard and document tray in the middle of the room, a black swivel chair pushed in; a grey fabric sofa with wooden armrests and a low wooden coffee table under the long window on the right; an open doorway with a grey metal frame on the left. Pale grey polished tile floor, white acoustic ceiling with recessed light panels.

summary:
[reference generation] The manager accuses the cleaner of stealing a customer's gold earring and orders her to empty her pockets; she refuses and backs away from the desk; the colleague by the sofa watches without moving.

retention_analysis:
<Subject 1> — 钱经理: fully_preserved - slicked-back oily hair, round face, dark grey buttoned waistcoat over a white shirt
<Subject 2> — 苏小满: fully_preserved - centre-parted black hair in a low practical ponytail, dark navy work shirt, worn grey apron
<Subject 3> — 小唐: fully_preserved - hair in a low ponytail, light-grey work shirt, light-grey apron
<Picture 4>: fully_preserved - light-oak cabinets, L-shaped desk, grey sofa on the right, doorway on the left

detailed_description:
HORIZONTAL 4:3 landscape framing, high-key commercial cinematography, soft broad daylight, luminous pale walls, refined natural faces. Keep the film texture, natural lighting, every face, every costume and the realistic motion consistent throughout. People stay standing, framed from the knees up. The camera is locked off for the whole clip: the framing never changes and the size of everything in frame stays the same from the first frame to the last. All movement comes from the people inside the fixed frame.
Exposure: the long right-hand window is the key light and soft bounced daylight fills the room; skin tones are bright and even, shadows sit in the light mid-tones, the whites stay white, and the picture carries an even high-key brightness from edge to edge.
Every shirt and waistcoat is buttoned right up to the closed collar, so each chest shows one continuous unbroken run of plain fabric with its own small plain buttons down the front. Apron bibs are plain unmarked fabric.
Speaker labels for this shot only: (S1) 钱经理, (S2) 苏小满, (S3) 小唐. Anyone not named here stays completely silent with a closed mouth.
The whole clip takes place in the one office shown in <Picture 4>, and the three of them hold these same standing places from the first frame to the last: 钱经理 (S1) behind the L-shaped desk in the middle of the room, three-quarters to the camera; 苏小满 (S2) at the near left corner of that desk in right profile facing right towards him, one step back from the wood, both feet flat on the tile; 小唐 (S3) on the right side of the room beside the grey sofa in left profile, one pace forward from it and clear of it, facing left towards the desk.

[Shot 1] Static Shot, medium-wide three-shot: 钱经理 (S1) behind the L-shaped desk with the unfolded paper spread flat on the wood before him; 苏小满 (S2) at the near left corner of the desk in right profile facing right, one step back from the wood; 小唐 (S3) beside the grey sofa at the right of frame in left profile, one pace forward from it.

[Shot 2] At 00:01.250, Camera: Static Shot, locked off, holding the exact same medium-wide three-shot framing of shot 1 with the same three people in the same places, 小唐 (S3) beside the grey sofa at the right of frame as she lifts her chin and her mouth opens and she speaks in a small tight Mandarin: [Chinese] 我看见她了。

[Shot 3] At 00:02.500, Camera: Static Shot, locked off, holding the exact same medium-wide three-shot framing of shot 1 with the same three people in the same places, 苏小满 (S2); her shoulders turn a few degrees toward the voice, the loose hair at her temple lifting slightly, and her hands stay at her own waist.

[Shot 4] At 00:03.750, Camera: Static Shot, locked off, holding the exact same medium-wide three-shot framing of shot 1 with the same three people in the same places, 钱经理 (S1) takes two fingers and slides the unfolded paper across the wood until its edge stops at the near lip, the paper scraping over the varnish, while 苏小满 (S2) stands at the near left corner of the desk in right profile and watches. The camera is locked off and does not move, follow, pan, or track in this beat.

[Shot 5] At 00:05.000, Camera: Static Shot, locked off, holding the exact same medium-wide three-shot framing of shot 1 with the same three people in the same places, 小唐 (S3) beside the grey sofa at the right of frame in left profile; her hands stay at her sides, her chin still lifted from where she spoke, and her eyes stay on 钱经理 (S1) off to the left of frame.

[Shot 6] At 00:06.500, Camera: Static Shot, locked off, holding the exact same medium-wide three-shot framing of shot 1 with the same three people in the same places, the paper lying flat at the middle of the desk, 钱经理 (S1) behind it with his hands flat, 苏小满 (S2) at the near left corner of the desk in right profile, 小唐 (S3) beside the grey sofa at the right of frame in left profile. All three hold their positions.

From [Shot 3] through [Shot 6] the only mouth movement is 小唐 (S3) swallowing; every line has finished, and the office falls into room tone.

No slow-motion, no soft dissolves, no fades, no unnecessary transitions; use hard cuts only and no on-screen text, letters, logos, subtitles, or watermarks.

overall_soundscape: A clock ticking on the wall and the low hum of the ceiling lights throughout; one short inhale from 小唐 at 1.1s before she speaks; the dry scrape of paper sliding over varnished wood from 3.8s to 5.0s; room tone.

non_diegetic_music: A low sustained string drone begins at 0s, a single muted cello note enters at 1.25s when she speaks, the rhythm thins to a held note from 5.0s, and the whole track fades out by 9.5s.
